Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.77,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}it wants to play again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.03,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}like a detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:04.40,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I won't let it get away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:06.35,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}it's constantly costuming
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:07.29,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}with loads of fake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.29,0:01:08.65,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I will strip search
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:09.62,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}if I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:11.92,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}no I'm not afraid to know it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:12.97,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}no no no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:14.89,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I am so determined
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:18.37,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}to chase after what's hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:20.31,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}and seize this day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:23.27,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}this moment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:26.69,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}(wanna know)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:28.69,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ENTER KEY to accelerate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.09,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}(wanna go)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:32.82,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ignition turned on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.56,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}it's about the time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.57,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}to drive to truth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:37.72,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}(wanna seize)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:39.77,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}stranger than any movies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:41.14,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}(wanna see)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:43.21,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ignorance is not bliss
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:45.92,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}(they say that truth will out)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:48.71,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}(can't keep on hiding)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:50.92,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}there's no turning back now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.32,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I'm gonna go on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:55.79,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I'm gonna go get what I want
