Comment: 0,1:59:59.93,1:59:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------PREV-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到天鹅绒房间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全仗客人的活跃表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才得以解决这次暗流涌动的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现实世界中的浓雾似乎也已消散
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够不为各种艰险所阻  坚持到现在实在是让人赞叹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦您了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:26.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必此时客人您也可尽情享受眼下的安宁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在暂且好好放松身心  沉浸于幸福之中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该也不是什么坏事吧
Comment: 0,1:59:59.93,1:59:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------TITLE-------------------
Comment: 0,1:59:59.93,1:59:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------TXTA-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24号有空吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24号？我应该有空的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  那就帮我空出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呐  去不去这个呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去呀去呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这蛋糕看上去真不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(320,22)\fs20\shad0\1c27B44D\bord4\3cFFFFFF\fsp1}12月24日圣诞蛋糕品尝会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶  圣诞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶  2…24号？可以啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就帮我空出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  有空  当然有空啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是嘛  那就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学长真是的  没想到这么大胆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:53.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有…是有空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  那到时候就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学长  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:02:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,12月24日  平安夜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说是情侣们一起度过的平安夜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟  怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都说没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  太好了  我还怕时间太紧可能会有问题呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  现在人也全了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就是为当天好好准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  大家一起在圣诞派对上疯个够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个  还有这个  这个也要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足立先生似乎已经全都招了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他承认都是他把山野女主播和小西学姐用天线吊死的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电视机里的事也不好解释
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:04:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在很多细节的地方好像还有不少问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「不过这些总会解决的」  堂岛舅舅是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算是结束了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  总算都结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你到底打算塞多少东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本用不到这么多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说为什么只有男生出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.31,0:04:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞节购物这种事好歹也该让女孩子也来帮下忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是傻子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们可是会用多到足以制造异形的无用食材塞满悠他家的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同地狱般的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  派对上的料理也绝对不能交给她们去做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本只能靠悠了  然后我们来打下手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须按照这个方针来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.37,0:04:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对的啦熊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女生就只负责吃咯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那倒还真有点羡慕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们这会儿肯定在家里无所事事  边说着「好期待明天呀」之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是你啊  圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用你的血  把这片雪原染成红色
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没辙啊  圣诞相关的只有这种片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无参考价值
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs20}（成龙传说3  沉睡于平安夜的成龙）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莴苣  满满的食物纤维
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs20}（想要与恋人一起度过的平安夜）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚的特别节目就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要与恋人一起度过的平安夜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个果然是约…约会的邀请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么呢  我和鸣上同学只是朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要拒绝么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行…既然已经答应人家了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  完全不知道该怎么办了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本周「GO!」的特刊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「还不算晚！圣诞节的人气时尚」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在全国各大书店热卖中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.39,0:05:44.67,pos2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(250,200)\1cA681E2\3cFFFFFF\be2\b1}圣诞特大号
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.39,0:05:44.67,pos2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(220,235)\bord1\3cA87EC8\shad2\4a00\4cA87EC8\b1\fscy150}完美的圣诞搭配{\fs12\1c7B9A81\3cFFFFFF\4c000000\4aAA\b0} 特集
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时尚…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底在干什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千枝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:06:41.73,pos2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(299,18)\1c5E5A63\bord1.5\3cFFFFFF}女性时尚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好巧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  真的好巧  你也要买这本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  不对  也不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里不对呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…对了  肉食特刊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说这周是肉食特刊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过也不知道是真的假的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正买了看下也没什么损失嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊  真是意外呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪子也要买这本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  我是听说这次有关于和服的粗缝的专题…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶…肉跟和服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.67,0:06:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这本杂志的内容还真是广泛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是让我把圣诞节的时间给空出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个应该就是约会的邀请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然说要约会真的是有点麻烦呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先  我和鸣上同学明明只是朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没想过交往的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}要一直在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是那样的话  鸣上同学不知道愿不愿意继承旅馆的事业呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过那也首先要从基础学起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒是很会做菜  要是做厨师的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以上菜了哦  老板娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定很合适呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走可爱风  还是性感风呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就应该先去问下学长的口味的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还是很开心  没想到可以两个人一起过平安夜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊  学长其实就是个天然呆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:42.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能顺利带节奏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一都在平安夜约会了  结果却毫无进展  那多寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.01,0:07:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么必胜杀招呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,礼物？惊喜？不…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是抓住他的胃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平安夜  情侣们一起度过的节日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那学长果然是在邀请我约会咯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  要冷静  白钟直斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和学长又不是那种关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能突然就说要在平安夜的时候约会了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是有其他目的或者意图吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要看穿真相…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  我是侦探  绝对可以发现真相的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有这种可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男生邀请女生这一行为在平安夜这一天是极为自然的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么如果是利用这种思维定势来做掩饰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际是另有目的而发出邀请可能性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说…单独把人叫出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把身为侦探的我…刺杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底在想些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位客人您没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说是圣诞节了  那送礼物是很自然的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天城学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直…直斗同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚是把什么藏起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是你的错觉啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么  真的没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我先走了  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那个的确是菜刀没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶器！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天明显不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学长的邀请竟然让我如此不平静嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静下来…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃点东西好好休息一下的话应该就能恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了  请教我能够一举拿下男生的必胜料理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事真的就拜托你啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了烧肉盖饭  爱佳一定还有别的拿手菜了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是个送外卖的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请教我能够一击必杀的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一…一击必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:30.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藏着凶器的天城学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探索着必杀方法的久慈川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两人是共犯应该不会错了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在收集到了这些证据之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经可以确定了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会在明天被杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事已至此  有必要先弄清谁是敌谁是友了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给予孩子们的梦就是要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是看这个让人心定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}快说出来  幕后黑手的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是直斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:05.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  是关于天城学姐的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}动手吧  就给我个痛快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的声音…感觉很像巽同学的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说他已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手吧  就给我个痛快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天究竟会发生怎样恐怖的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能成为足以留下回忆的一天就好了  明天…
Comment: 0,1:59:59.93,1:59:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------TXTB-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来不了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  本来替班的那人突然请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳介和熊熊就被叫过来顶班了熊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6点的派对应该是能赶上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是应该没法来帮老师做准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才完二也打电话给我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是要带腰疼的妈妈去医院也不能来帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶  那就是说老师你要不得不一个人准备咯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了熊  那作为补偿我帮你准备帮手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我会试着拜托可能会帮忙的人的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师你就安心地在家里等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了  那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给熊熊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然离约定的6点还很早
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但期待过头忍不住就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能跟学长一起待更长的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了  忘记去买东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有去买的空闲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  帮手来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮手怎么会找理世啊  熊熊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只要进入厨房那就全完了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看学长的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是学长的房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  学长  为了今天我想了很多很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什么能让学长高兴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.88,0:13:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如礼物啊料理啊  想了很多很多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是结果还是没有什么灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想着献给学长所想的全部东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  那可以拜托她去买东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呐  学长  你最想让我干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先去给我买新卷鲑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新卷鲑么  新卷鲑新卷鲑…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道JUNES里有没有卖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:01.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到约定的时间之前一定要问清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸣上同学的真实想法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀着这么紧张的心情怎么能熬到晚上嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  接着就是收获了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  这是堂岛家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是悠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舅舅？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  你在家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实啊  菜菜子临时出院的申请已经批下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  从明天起能暂时在家里待几天了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以啊  不好意思了  你能不能带几件菜菜子的换洗衣物到医院
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的话  希望你马上带来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶  马上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那个啊  鸣上同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来确认鸣上同学的心意的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来的正好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不住了  帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天完全睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去等不到晚上的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不确认鸣上同学的真实心意的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  这是自家种的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能感受到匠师的技艺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了  忘记关火了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天城
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个啊  鸣上同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能不能帮我看着锅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着就行了  拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊熊到底叫了几个帮手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锅应该指的是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:16:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  为什么我一定要在平安夜去别人家帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  我希望你和一条君还有长濑君去帮帮老师嘛熊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  这回就帮一下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没人来开门啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里  中  千  枝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海老原…同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在平安夜  学长邀我…那…那个…晚上去约会什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能  对  一定是出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论要被卷进什么事情当中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都必须找出真相
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学长  我买来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是这样  你这个人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}不要扔啊  不要扔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千枝啊  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没上锁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事  这副惨象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么在这种地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶  直斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  学长你用那把菜刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是庆祝菜菜子能临时出院和圣诞节啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起啊  圣诞派对本应该是昨天举办的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  昨天发生了很多事情总之就延期了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  发生了很多很多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多呢很多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多很多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了  哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要担心  菜菜子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个啊  有礼物送给菜菜子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锵~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟熊熊长得一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.89,0:19:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便一提  这是根据熊熊的原型精心做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢  菜菜子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之结果还是不错的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.39,0:19:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  能成为一个美好的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新年快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雪了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了  熊熊版雪人好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了一个美好的回忆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次也做吧  雪人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这完全是感冒了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:21:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂岛叔叔和菜菜子都回医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无须担心熊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊熊住这儿来照顾老师熊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好狡猾的说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说没事吧  让这家伙来照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起这个  要不要把他移到床上去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.37,0:21:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被炉有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶  身体烧起来的话不应该用被炉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子滑雪旅行得延期了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  这是为了给鸣上同学创造回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.73,0:21:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是本人不在的话就没意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创造…回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要勉强自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间还有的是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是想遵守约定的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过已经没关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没这个必要了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:21:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次真的是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:21:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是向你告别来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你在一起的时光很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.83,0:22:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告别
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  我不会忘记的  至今为止…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.23,0:22:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也会一直一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Comment: 0,1:59:59.93,1:59:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------NEXT-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵异照片
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就是很普通地拍下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  这不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  要去上了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.90,0:24:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah~
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go~
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.69,0:24:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能收下吗
